        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Antero Midstream Corporation together with its consolidated subsidiaries (“Antero Midstream,” the “Company,” “we,” “us” or “our”) is a growth-oriented midstream energy company formed to own, operate and develop midstream energy assets that primarily service Antero Resources’ production and completion activity in the Appalachian Basin located in West Virginia and Ohio.",
        "start_character": 48,
        "end_character": 418
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "As a result of our relationship with Antero Resources, we do not compete for the portion of Antero Resources’ existing operations for which we currently provide midstream services and will not compete for future portions of Antero Resources’ operations that are dedicated to us pursuant to: (i) our gathering and compression agreements;",
        "start_character": 20981,
        "end_character": 21317
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we also provide other fluid handling services.",
        "start_character": 15927,
        "end_character": 15986
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we believe that the various activities in which we are presently engaged that are subject to environmental laws and regulations are not expected to materially interrupt or diminish our operational ability to gather natural gas and provide water handling services.",
        "start_character": 38150,
        "end_character": 38426
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In connection with our entry into the Joint Venture with MarkWest, we released to the Joint Venture our right to provide certain processing and fractionation services on 195,000 gross acres held by Antero Resources in the Appalachian Basin.",
        "start_character": 16885,
        "end_character": 17125
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Pursuant to the water services agreement, we provide certain water handling services to Antero Resources within an area of dedication in defined service areas in Ohio and West Virginia.",
        "start_character": 14982,
        "end_character": 15167
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Such physical risks may also impact the infrastructure on which we rely to provide our services.",
        "start_character": 64100,
        "end_character": 64196
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Upon expiration of the Marcellus gathering and compression agreement, the Utica compression agreement and the Mountaineer gathering and compression agreement, we will continue to provide gathering and compression services under the 2019 gathering and compression agreement.",
        "start_character": 12167,
        "end_character": 12440
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We also have certain rights of first offer with respect to water services for acreage located outside of the existing dedicated areas.",
        "start_character": 15168,
        "end_character": 15302
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
        "accession_number": "0001104659-26-013380",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-11",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We have agreements in place to provide gathering and compression services through 2038 and water services through 2035.",
        "start_character": 1846,
        "end_character": 1965
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0001104659-26-013380",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0001104659-26-013380-f9055ba39857ed93",
